Name: mozangle
Short Name: mozangle
URL: https://github.com/servo/mozangle
Version: 0.7.1
Revision: db4633ea0ce432fcb76d1ff3d38b513463b350df
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py mozangle, history replayed linearly)
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Mozilla's fork of Google ANGLE, repackaged as a Rust crate.

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/mozangle/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/mozangle/ unchanged.

Crates:
  mozangle 0.7.1 third_party/mozangle/mozangle
